flowchart LR
    subgraph Local[Deterministic local catalog - zero LLM tokens]
        Home[Top-level home directories] --> Discover[discover_projects.py]
        Discover -->|create-only| Notes[Obsidian project notes]
        Discover --> Canvas[JSON Canvas project map]
        Notes --> Graph[existing graph-viz.sh]
        Graph --> MOC[_MOC.md Mermaid]
        Graph --> HTML[grafo.html]
    end

    subgraph Ingest[OpenCode on-demand ingestion]
        Source[URL, PDF, YouTube, local text] --> Extract[Defuddle, WebFetch, pdftotext, yt-dlp, Read]
        Extract --> Search[Targeted Grep, max five notes]
        Search --> Router[local-model-router ask_chat_model]
        Router --> Preview[Exact preview and human approval]
        Preview -->|create-only| SourceNote[Obsidian source note]
    end

    SourceNote --> Notes
